      "message": "This attempts to mitigate CVE-2024-45338 in https://chromium.googlesource.com/webpagereplay.git.  However in the previous fix for https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/catapult/+/6309326 which is for wpgo in catapult, a new CVE was created https://issues.chromium.org/issues/404179134 for golang.org/x/net version 0.33.0 and suggested fix is to move to 0.36.0, so I am directly going from 0.23.0 to 0.36.0.\n\nAlso, can someone explain to what the difference is between wprogo in https://chormium.googlesource.webpagereplay.git and the version in https://chromium.googlesource.com/catapult.  \n\nThanks.",
